  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "The Riddle Game (roadmap: riddle-game): the whispering wretch of Bree Cave — strongly implied to be, but never named, Gollum. Weekly 7-riddle Tolkien trivia minigame (win 5/7), quest_cd_inc calendar-weekly. Script-spawned at waypoint AP_riddlegame_1 by q_rid_spawn (fired from breecave OnEnter wrapper q_rid_enter); never hand-placed. Separate from the placed CR-1029 gollum.utc boss on the Roll of the Fallen."
  },
